!!! Constructing a record with the wrong number of field values.
!!!
!!! This used to emit a STRUCT_CTOR_MISMATCH pseudo-instruction into the
!!! artifact. No loader knows that opcode, so the compiler exited 0, the build
!!! reported success, and the failure appeared only when the interpreter loaded
!!! the program: "Unknown NIL opcode 'STRUCT_CTOR_MISMATCH'" against a line of
!!! generated NIL, with nothing pointing back at the source. The emitted
!!! operand even carried the right source line, and the loader never used it.
book diagnostics.record-construction-arity

Holder begin record
    field slot as number
end record

main returns number begin paragraph
    variable held as Holder is Holder with nothing
    give 0
end paragraph
